OL,3,ARussell Brand found guilty of rape and
OL,4,Asexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrand was taken into custody after the
OL,7,Fverdicts were delivered, and was
OL,8,Frefused bail. He is due to be sentenced
OL,9,Fon Monday.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
