OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACalifornia governor commutes death
OL,4,Asentences for all 548 people on death
OL,5,Arow
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe decision to spare death row inmates
OL,8,Fis largely symbolic in a state that has
OL,9,Fnot executed a prisoner since 2006,
OL,10,Fthough experts say it could save
OL,11,Fmillions of dollars in court costs each
OL,12,Fyear. Only 13 inmates have been
OL,13,Fexecuted since voters reinstated the
OL,14,Fdeath penalty in 1978.
OL,16,FThe decision comes as Newsom, the
OL,17,FDemocratic leader of the most populous
OL,18,FUS state, has been discussed as a
OL,19,Fpossible 2028 contender for president.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
